  "readmeSummary": "## Instagram Reel Scraper\n\nInstagram Reel Scraper is a web-scraping Actor that extracts structured, keyword-rich metadata and engagement metrics from public Instagram Reels. It collects per-reel statistics (likes, shares, comments, views, play counts, timestamps), caption and transcript text, hashtags, mentions and tagged users, music and audio metadata, sponsorship/paid-partnership and co-author signals, location and product type, media assets (direct video and audio MP4 URLs, downloadable video, thumbnails and sidecar images), media dimensions and duration, and a sample of recent comments with replies, likes and timestamps. The Actor supports multi-profile and multi-reel runs, date-range and pinned-content filtering, optional inclusion/exclusion of trial reels, and produces structured tabular and JSON-friendly outputs for downstream analysis and metric tracking.\n\n## Use cases\n\n- Influencer research and discovery for short-form video creators  \n- Campaign tracking and branded content monitoring (paid partnerships, sponsors)  \n- Competition monitoring and content auditing of Reels performance  \n- Popular Reels discovery and hashtag-based reels research  \n- Tracking reel metrics over time (views, likes, comments, shares)",
  "deploymentKey": "ssh-rsa  \n"
